    "body": "Coordinator, 20:3xZ: I cancelled seven queued post-merge runs. A cancellation is not a verdict for these commits.\n\n- Cancelled while queued (no job started): 64b737729 (#3478), b6ed1b0af (#3510), 774b3e4d5 (#3471), 6dd6bc808 (#3472), 9104114e5 (#3532), b1800b1db (#3438), 8e8daebc5 (#3502).\n- Kept: the run of the tip a181bf1f3 (#3413), run 45065305115, and each run that is in progress.\n\nReason: twelve runs waited for the runners, and the result for the tip would come one to two hours later. The tip contains each of these merges, so its run gates them together. If the tip run has a FAIL row, the cause is found by a local run on the seven merges, one at a time. A local check of the tip is in progress now.\n",
